<title>UK: BT APPOINTS GTS AS DISTRIBUTOR IN HUNGARY.</title>
<headline>BT APPOINTS GTS AS DISTRIBUTOR IN HUNGARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc (BT) said it had appointed GTS Hungary, a subsidiary of Global TeleSystems Group Inc, as its distributor of Concert services in Hungary.</p>
<p>It said it had also launched Concert Frame Relay Services.</p>
<p>Concert is BT's joint venture with MCI which provides managed networks.</p>
